{"4573270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "中等生", "steam_appid": 4573270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >距离高考倒计时还有100天，成绩还是怎么也上不去......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >明明曾经是老师和母父的骄傲，调到重点班之后，怎么就成了班上的透明人？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >算了，只要考上足够好的大学，就能摆脱陈旧的生活，逃离束缚自己的一切。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那时候的周语桐是这样想的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >按照往常一样，读书、考试、复习.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >直到和昔日好友冲突，身边人的看法各不相同。谁会影响她的选择？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >意气风发的竞赛生同桌？看起来并不好接近的隔壁班女生？从小一起长大的青梅？还是曾经与她分享同一个子宫，分享着彼此重叠的命运轨迹的姐姐？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她们似乎对此有着不同的态度——靠近、沉默、羡慕、远行……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只要考上大学，一切都会好起来的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >真的会好起来吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那个被许诺的充满光明的日子，真的会到来吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >未来......在多远的以后？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >角色介绍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/e415c586a50a907430f460d41d8bfd70.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/e415c586a50a907430f460d41d8bfd70.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>田梓妍</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >班长兼同桌，竞赛生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完美主义，重视成绩，什么都想做到最好。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无法正视自己的情感，时常感到难以表达自己的需求和欲望。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/c007f3055ec5a2b1571a518b6918b555.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/c007f3055ec5a2b1571a518b6918b555.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>林溪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >故意绕远路回家的隔壁班女生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >据说是文学社社长，但学校还有没有文学社一直存疑。高中时期喜欢张爱玲、简媜等作家。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >传言多次被投上校园表白墙，周围同学评价非常两极分化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/cfce0ebff838fa48e839b5764eff53e4.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/cfce0ebff838fa48e839b5764eff53e4.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>陈真</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >认为烤面包做蛋糕很幸福。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >想要给身边人带来更多幸福，早早认定了自己要读食品烘焙相关的专业。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/a12a578c21a7922f168a05af1a516ff7.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/a12a578c21a7922f168a05af1a516ff7.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>蒋梅</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >曾用名周梅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >似乎和家里断绝了关系，但是那里有一个人......好像怎么也断不掉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏内容</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《中等生》是一款视觉小说类游戏，探讨中式教育环境中如何解构优绩主义、实现自我成长，内含学生时代小团体友谊、微妙的恶意等要素，玩家将影响高中生周语桐与四位攻略对象的关系。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏内容包括22W+字剧情文本，4位可攻略角色，3位重要配角，14个结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >可能引发的不适的内容</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.内含言语霸凌、好友背刺、原生家庭等引发PTSD的要素，无好感线有角色死亡走向。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.内含骨科要素。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.本故事纯属虚构，请勿代入现实。</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >距离高考倒计时还有100天，成绩还是怎么也上不去......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >明明曾经是老师和母父的骄傲，调到重点班之后，怎么就成了班上的透明人？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >算了，只要考上足够好的大学，就能摆脱陈旧的生活，逃离束缚自己的一切。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那时候的周语桐是这样想的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >按照往常一样，读书、考试、复习.......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >直到和昔日好友冲突，身边人的看法各不相同。谁会影响她的选择？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >意气风发的竞赛生同桌？看起来并不好接近的隔壁班女生？从小一起长大的青梅？还是曾经与她分享同一个子宫，分享着彼此重叠的命运轨迹的姐姐？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她们似乎对此有着不同的态度——靠近、沉默、羡慕、远行……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >只要考上大学，一切都会好起来的。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >真的会好起来吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那个被许诺的充满光明的日子，真的会到来吗？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >未来......在多远的以后？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >角色介绍</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/e415c586a50a907430f460d41d8bfd70.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/e415c586a50a907430f460d41d8bfd70.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>田梓妍</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >班长兼同桌，竞赛生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完美主义，重视成绩，什么都想做到最好。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无法正视自己的情感，时常感到难以表达自己的需求和欲望。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/c007f3055ec5a2b1571a518b6918b555.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/c007f3055ec5a2b1571a518b6918b555.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>林溪</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >故意绕远路回家的隔壁班女生。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >据说是文学社社长，但学校还有没有文学社一直存疑。高中时期喜欢张爱玲、简媜等作家。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >传言多次被投上校园表白墙，周围同学评价非常两极分化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/cfce0ebff838fa48e839b5764eff53e4.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/cfce0ebff838fa48e839b5764eff53e4.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>陈真</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >认为烤面包做蛋糕很幸福。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >想要给身边人带来更多幸福，早早认定了自己要读食品烘焙相关的专业。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras/a12a578c21a7922f168a05af1a516ff7.avif?t=1776182358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/extras_big/a12a578c21a7922f168a05af1a516ff7.webp?t=1776182358 width=1560 height=877 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>蒋梅</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >曾用名周梅。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >似乎和家里断绝了关系，但是那里有一个人......好像怎么也断不掉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏内容</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《中等生》是一款视觉小说类游戏，探讨中式教育环境中如何解构优绩主义、实现自我成长，内含学生时代小团体友谊、微妙的恶意等要素，玩家将影响高中生周语桐与四位攻略对象的关系。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏内容包括22W+字剧情文本，4位可攻略角色，3位重要配角，14个结局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >可能引发的不适的内容</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.内含言语霸凌、好友背刺、原生家庭等引发PTSD的要素，无好感线有角色死亡走向。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.内含骨科要素。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.本故事纯属虚构，请勿代入现实。</p>", "short_description": "这是一部中式校园（高三）为背景的百合向视觉小说。 只要考上大学，一切都会好起来吗？手牵着手，心跳扑通扑通，我们只是朋友吗？大家说只是开个玩笑，感到不舒服是正常的吗？想要挣脱母亲的期待，这是不孝吗？您将跟随主角周语桐，探索青春期的疑惑，帮她作出选择。", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/2bf80723ffc1e8766bd292617bc80083b706d4be/header.jpg?t=1776182358", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/6cdb43d2a4fc2f2ab3f5dddd0221da4bd6581ab6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776182358", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/6cdb43d2a4fc2f2ab3f5dddd0221da4bd6581ab6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776182358", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 及以上<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["土酪鸡喵"], "publishers": ["土酪鸡喵"], "demos": [{"appid": 4769370, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/69887ba2db8fc732c697985638d2f9f9a0a8f4a0/ss_69887ba2db8fc732c697985638d2f9f9a0a8f4a0.600x338.jpg?t=1776182358", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4573270/69887ba2db8fc732c697985638d2f9f9a0a8f4a0/ss_69887ba2db8fc732c697985638d2f9f9a0a8f4a0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776182358"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.a